      "content": "that sounds like just a polite way to say \"keep working harder\" but that's the thing... I can't. the drive is just gone. it's not even sadness, it's just this heavy realization that the effort doesn't actually matter in the long run. whether I spend another decade or just stop right now, the universe stays exactly the same. it feels like I'm just performing a role that has no audience and no script. it's exhausting to pretend there's a destination when you realize the path is just an infinite loop of nothingness.",
